  "statement": "What is the value of \\[\\frac{\\left(1+\\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)}{\\sqrt{\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{5^2}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{7^2}\\right)}}?\\]",
